  "name": "What's [Heavier] to Carry? A/B/C/D Quiz",
  "niche": "trending",
  "description": "A talking-head poses a simple either/or question, then reveals answers A/B/C/D — each flagged by a big centered letter and a full-screen b-roll cut. Options A, B and D are mundane/literal objects that frame option C, a slow emotional metaphor delivered as voiceover over moody b-roll with captions; ends on a comedic option D and a 'follow for more' CTA.",
